 <script defer="" src="/static/help_links.js?v=1.34.19-ui41"></script><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><title>Contact &amp; support · Wavelink</title><link href="/static/icon.ico?v=1.34.19-ui31" rel="icon"/><link href="/static/style.css?v=1.34.19-ui60" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/static/guide.css?v=1.34.19" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body><main class="guide"><a class="back" href="/">← Back to Wavelink</a><div class="overline"><img alt="Wavelink" src="/static/wavelink-mark.svg?v=1.34.19-ui31"/>WAVELINK / AJ OFFSHORE SOLUTIONS 1.34.19 · UI60</div><h1>Wavelink support</h1><p class="lead">Support, feedback and practical ideas from the field.</p><section class="panel"><div class="overline">CONTACT &amp; SUPPORT</div><h2>Adriano Carneiro</h2><p><a href="mailto:support@mywavelink.com" id="email-address">support@mywavelink.com</a></p><label for="support-reason">What would you like to discuss?</label><select id="support-reason"><option>Technical support</option><option>Report an issue</option><option>Suggest a feature</option><option>Customisation / other enquiry</option></select><div class="row contact-actions"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:support@mywavelink.com" id="write-email">Write email</a><button id="copy-email" type="button">Copy email address</button></div><p aria-live="polite" id="contact-status" role="status"></p><p class="muted">Write email opens your configured mail app with a suggested subject and message. Nothing is sent automatically. You review the message and press Send in your mail app.</p></section><section class="columns"><div class="panel"><h2>Reporting a problem</h2><p>Include the app version, what you were trying to do, and the exact error. A screenshot of a test record is useful.</p><p>From the Windows Admin, open <strong>Contact → Export diagnostic logs</strong> ou <strong>Backups &amp; support → Export diagnostic logs</strong>. Review the contents before attaching them yourself.</p></div><div class="panel"><h2>Keep your data private</h2><p>Do not send passwords, private certificate keys, operational records or client information without authorisation. Logs may contain network addresses, local paths and error details.</p><p>This page is not an emergency channel. Follow vessel and company procedures for urgent operational issues.</p></div></section><script defer="" src="/static/support.js?v=1.34.19-ui118"></script><footer class="panel"><strong>Wavelink · AJ Offshore Solutions</strong><p>Developed by Adriano Carneiro. Operations, equipment and team coordination; no procedure approval or operational authorisation is implied.</p><a href="/help" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Guia do usuário</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact &amp; support</a> · <a href="/examples">Exemplos de configuração</a> · <a href="/install" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Install app / home-screen help</a></footer></main></body></html>--- UI119/app/static/pt-BR/document_join.html
