 <script defer="" src="/static/help_links.js?v=1.34.19-ui41"></script><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><title>Example checklist setups | Wavelink</title><link href="/static/icon.ico?v=1.34.19-ui31" rel="icon"/><link href="/static/style.css?v=1.34.19-ui60" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/static/guide.css?v=1.34.19" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body><main class="guide"><a class="back" href="/help" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">← Full user guide</a><div class="overline"><img alt="Wavelink" src="/static/wavelink-mark.svg?v=1.34.19-ui31"/>WAVELINK / AJ OFFSHORE SOLUTIONS 1.33.1</div><h1>Learn from a checklist example</h1><p class="lead">Compare sections, stage assignments, optional and required readings, and separate approval before building your own.</p><aside class="panel"><strong>TRAINING EXAMPLES — not operational procedures.</strong><p>TRAINING EXAMPLE — replace the illustrative wording with your approved procedure. Review every item, reading and approver before publishing. This is not a complete operational checklist.</p><p>The practice numeric field demonstrates a range of 0–100 and accepts decimals. It is not an equipment limit or a package-count rule. Replace it with a meaningful reading and approved bounds for your checklist.</p></aside><section class="panel"><h2>Create an editable example draft</h2><ol><li>Na administração, abra <strong>Checklist Editor → Example setups</strong> and select an example.</li><li>Usar <strong>Verificar configuração de revisores</strong>. The preview shows whether its example departments exist and have enabled members.</li><li>Escolher <strong>Use example as new draft</strong>, give it a name and confirm. This does not overwrite the selected checklist, publish it or copy answers.</li><li>Review every item and its stage. Add users in <strong>Usuários e acesso</strong>; assign membership in <strong>Departamentos</strong>. On a draft item, choose another active department or a named person where needed. Missing departments and accounts are never created automatically.</li><li><strong>Salvar rascunho</strong>. After review, <strong>Publicar revisão</strong>. New records start with every item Pending. Existing records stay unchanged.</li></ol><p><a href="/help/topics/departments" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Department and reviewer setup</a> · <a href="/help/topics/create" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Manual checklist creation</a></p><p>Examples on this page are read-only. Use the Windows editor to create the editable draft.</p></section><details data-example-id="example-manual"><summary>Build your first checklist — example</summary><p><strong>Lista de verificação</strong> · 1 stage(s) · 5 items</p><p>Exemplos de departamentos: <strong>Party Chief, Processing</strong>. An assigned reviewer may also have checked the item; both actions are recorded.</p><section data-section-id="example-manual-s1"><h3>01 · Setup basics</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="example-simple" data-phases="pre"><td>01 · Example: confirm the job reference and responsible team are recorded.</td><td>Lista de verificação</td><td>No reading field</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr><tr data-item-id="example-reading" data-phases="pre"><td>02 · Example: record a document or evidence reference.</td><td>Lista de verificação</td><td>Evidence / document reference (text; required)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr><tr data-item-id="example-number" data-phases="pre"><td>03 · Example: enter a practice numeric value to learn how a bounded reading works.</td><td>Lista de verificação</td><td>Practice value (demonstration only) (number; required; demonstration range 0–100; not an operational limit)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-section-id="example-manual-s2"><h3>02 · Review and approval</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="example-approved" data-phases="pre"><td>01 · Example: submit the prepared evidence for Processing review.</td><td>Lista de verificação</td><td>Handover evidence (text; required)</td><td>Processando</td></tr><tr data-item-id="example-closeout" data-phases="pre"><td>02 · Example: record the Party Chief review of the agreed task scope.</td><td>Lista de verificação</td><td>Agreed scope reference (text; required)</td><td>Party Chief</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></details><details data-example-id="example-mobilisation"><summary>Vessel mobilisation — setup example</summary><p><strong>Mobilização</strong> · 1 stage(s) · 4 items</p><p>Exemplos de departamentos: <strong>Party Chief</strong>. An assigned reviewer may also have checked the item; both actions are recorded.</p><section data-section-id="example-mobilisation-s1"><h3>01 · Scope and evidence</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="mob-scope" data-phases="pre"><td>01 · Example: record the vessel mobilisation scope reference.</td><td>Mobilização</td><td>Approved scope reference (text; required)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr><tr data-item-id="mob-evidence" data-phases="pre"><td>02 · Example: record the relevant equipment documentation reference.</td><td>Mobilização</td><td>Document reference (text; required)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-section-id="example-mobilisation-s2"><h3>02 · Review and handover</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="mob-review" data-phases="pre"><td>01 · Example: submit mobilisation evidence for Party Chief review.</td><td>Mobilização</td><td>Review package reference (text; required)</td><td>Party Chief</td></tr><tr data-item-id="mob-team" data-phases="pre"><td>02 · Example: record that the agreed handover information was shared with the team.</td><td>Mobilização</td><td>Handover note (text; optional)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></details><details data-example-id="example-processing"><summary>Data handover — setup example</summary><p><strong>Prepare → Receive</strong> · 2 stage(s) · 4 items</p><p>Exemplos de departamentos: <strong>Processando</strong>. An assigned reviewer may also have checked the item; both actions are recorded.</p><section data-section-id="example-processing-s1"><h3>01 · Prepare handover</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="data-package" data-phases="pre"><td>01 · Example: record the data package identifier.</td><td>Preparar</td><td>Package identifier (text; required)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr><tr data-item-id="data-review" data-phases="pre"><td>02 · Example: submit the package evidence for Processing review.</td><td>Preparar</td><td>Review evidence (text; required)</td><td>Processando</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-section-id="example-processing-s2"><h3>02 · Receive and record</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Etapa</th><th scope="col">Configuração de leituras</th><th scope="col">Aprovação separada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-item-id="data-receive" data-phases="post"><td>01 · Example: record the receiving team handover reference.</td><td>Receber</td><td>Receipt reference (text; required)</td><td>Não obrigatório</td></tr><tr data-item-id="data-accept" data-phases="post"><td>02 · Example: request Processing review of the receipt evidence.</td><td>Receber</td><td>Evidence reference (text; required)</td><td>Processando</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></details><section class="panel"><h2>Stage order and optional fields</h2><p>The first two examples have one stage. Data handover has <strong>Preparar</strong> e <strong>Receber</strong>; finalise Prepare before finalising Receive. The Stage column identifies every item’s assignment.</p><p>A required reading must be supplied before completing its item. An optional reading may stay blank. Justified N/A entries still require any configured separate approval.</p><h2>Checking is separate from approval</h2><p>The technician checks and synchronises an item; its required approval remains outstanding until an assigned reviewer acts online, including the checker when assigned. Being an administrator is not an approval override. Approval is required only for the selected items.</p><p>Live editing is enabled separately on each record and is off by default. Loading an example does not enable it automatically.</p></section><footer class="panel"><strong>Wavelink · AJ Offshore Solutions</strong><p>Adriano Carneiro · <a href="mailto:support@mywavelink.com">support@mywavelink.com</a></p><a href="/help" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Guia do usuário</a></footer></main></body></html>--- UI119/app/static/pt-BR/fleet.html
